    <briefdescription>
<para>Group LC — Plugin lifecycle tests (load / unload / reload / concurrency). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Verifies that <ref refid="classthemis_1_1llamacpp_1_1_llama_cpp_plugin" kindref="compound">LlamaCppPlugin</ref> transitions correctly between the unloaded → loaded → unloaded states and that repeated or concurrent lifecycle operations are safe.</para>
<para>All tests run under THEMIS_LLAMA_CPP_STUB_MODE; no real model is required. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
